{
  "id": "add-users",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "How to add a new user",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-01",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2"
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "In this video, you'll learn how to add a new user to Sloneek and fill in their basic details.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "#navigation_company_staff",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "hold_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "In the left menu, under Company, click Users to expand the user section.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#navigation_company_staff"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "#navigation_settings_users"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "Then choose Management to open the list of all users in your company.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "#navigation_settings_users"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": ".slnk-h1:text-is(\"Management of users\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/users"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "Click the Add button at the top of the page to start creating a new user.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"addUserButton\"] button"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"usersCreateForm\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/company-details/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "First, set the status. Select The user is not active, so Petra can't log in before her first day.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"userInactiveRadio\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"hirePacketSelect\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "Under Basic information, fill in the required Name and Surname fields.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"firstNameInput\"]",
          "value": "Petra",
          "clear": true
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"surnameInput\"]",
          "value": "Example",
          "clear": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "Next, enter the new colleague's work email address. The Email field is required too.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"emailInput\"]",
          "value": "video.demo+{{RUN_ID}}@example.com",
          "clear": true,
          "delay_ms": 40
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "Optionally, assign a team. Open the Team dropdown and pick Marketing.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"teamsSelect\"] button"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=\"team-Marketing\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"teamsSelect\"] button:text-is(\"Marketing\")"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "When everything looks right, click Create user in the top right corner to save.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"submitButton\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete .user_name:text-is(\"Example Petra (Inactive)\")",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "That's it. Petra now has her own user profile, where you can add more details anytime.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete .user_name:text-is(\"Example Petra (Inactive)\")"
        }
      ],
      "hold_after_ms": 1500
    }
  ]
}